doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21609660
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Software accompanying the paper "Analyzing the Impact of DVFS and System
  Noise on Merge Sort Benchmarking Through System Quiescing". The repository
  contains the source code and experimental artifacts used to investigate the
  effects of Dynamic Voltage and Frequency Scaling (DVFS), system noise, and
  system quiescing on execution-time measurements and benchmarking reliability.

keywords:
  - DVFS
  - Dynamic Voltage and Frequency Scaling
  - Performance Engineering
  - Performance Benchmarking
  - Merge Sort
  - System Quiescing
  - System Noise
  - Thermal Throttling
  - Performance Measurement

